{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12244070","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12244070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1224407001:1":{"text":"シンドバッドさん、どうしてこんな所にいるのですか？ずっと探してたんですよ！","source_cn":"辛巴达，你怎么躲在这里？我们找了你好久！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x842FF176507F5C85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1224407002:1":{"text":"あんたらこそなんで来た？今ごろ広場は盛り上がってるだろ？公開裁判なんてめったにないからな。","source_cn":"干嘛来找我？现在这时间，你们该去广场上凑凑热闹。公审罪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6214827B5ADCACB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1224407003:1":{"text":"その口ぶりだと、一緒に来るつもりはないんですね？","source_cn":"听你的语气，不打算和我们一起去吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x645ACF2A3DFF2E58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1224407004:1":{"text":"……そうは言ってないだろ。","source_cn":"……我没说这话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26C1DF98A4D42AFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1224407005:1":{"text":"口に出さなくても、態度に現れてますよ。","source_cn":"你是没这么说，但你就是这个意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB261C6E64E107BCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_t